    <p class="overline-gold">Tooling / Harnesses</p>
    <h1 class="heading-display-light" style="font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 4vw, 3.25rem); margin-bottom: 1.25rem; max-width: 24ch;">Capabilities come from harnesses. Activation stays explicit.</h1>
    <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; color: rgb(245 239 224 / 75%); max-width: 56ch; line-height: 1.7;">A compatible harness packages reusable agentic capabilities. The CLI manages verified installation; you decide which capabilities belong in user or repository scope.</p>
